1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Okay, now let me get this straight.
They can't avenge them,

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
because they're arguing over
whether they're dead or altered?

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Some things never change.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
They always lose sight
of what's important,

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
so we're gonna do things our way.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
If anyone interferes,
we'll take them down,

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
as simple as that.

8
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,000
[singer singing in English]

9
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,000
[explosion]

10
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,000
[narrator] Zazan has built her nest
in Meteor City.

11
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,000
[Bonolenov] Where's everyone else?

12
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,000
[Kalluto] That took longer than expected.

13
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,000
Nasty habit.

14
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,000
I really need to stop toying with my prey.

15
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,000
[laughs]

16
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,000
[laughing]

17
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,000
You're just no match for me.

18
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:32,000
Why don't you come back
when you've gotten your act together?

19
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,000
[Feitan] It looks like I'm out of shape.

20
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:45,000
But it's a good chance to practice.

21
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,000
[grunting]

22
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,000
[laughing]

23
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,000
[gasps]

24
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,000
I need to create an opening.

25
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:24,000
that girl somehow manages to make
that stupid vacuum appear out of nowhere.

26
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:35,000
Hmm, and I can't seem to catch her
with my gossamer.

27
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:38,000
This girl is surprisingly good,

28
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:40,000
but I cannot allow her
to escape my clutches.

29
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,000
I really hate to do this.

30
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:45,000
It's so hard on my butt.

31
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,000
But I have no choice!

32
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:57,000
[Pike] Love Shower!

33
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:03,000
[Shizuku] Whoa.
He might have me this time.

34
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,000
[Pike laughs]

35
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:07,000
With all the silk I keep spinning,

36
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:11,000
you've got nowhere to run to now.
Lucky me.

37
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:16,000
[laughs] Gotcha!

38
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:26,000
Even Bihorn couldn't snap my silk
when he tried,

39
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:29,000
and he's the strongest
out of all of us, no question.

40
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:36,000
Now, then, time to hand you
over to Mistress Zazan.

41
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:07,000
You took your clothes off.

42
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,000
I get it.

43
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:16,000
She widened an opening in my web
to slip through while protecting her skin.

44
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,000
With her power, it's certainly feasible.

45
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,000
[Shizuku grunts]

46
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:23,000
[Pike] She left her vacuum in the web,

47
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:36,000
[Shizuku] Maybe not,
but I could say the same thing to you.

48
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:39,000
I've been able to learn
the range and speed of your silk.

49
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:44,000
I won't mention that his anus
twitches twice before he fires.

50
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:48,000
I'll just keep my distance from now on,

51
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:50,000
so Blinky and I get the win.

52
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:53,000
[Pike] Win? [laughs]

53
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:03,000
I said that I'm going
to be keeping my distance,

54
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,000
not that I'm gonna run away.

55
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:07,000
Hmm?

56
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:09,000
Hold on a sec.
I'll show you the difference.

57
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:12,000
-Ready, Blinky?
-Gyo gyo.

58
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:15,000
Suck up every last drop of blood
from his body.

59
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,000
Gyo gyo!

60
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:20,000
[gasps] Hey.

61
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:23,000
Hold on a second. What?

62
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,000
Uh-oh. This is bad.

63
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:46,000
I'm getting dizzy.
I have to stop the bleeding.

64
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,000
[muffled] How's that?

65
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:58,000
Now you can't suck my blood…

66
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,000
[gasping]

67
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,000
[whimpering]

68
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:11,000
This is too much.
I can't cover them all at once.

69
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:16,000
Well, of course you can't.
I gave you exactly 29 bleeding wounds.

70
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,000
By my current calculations,

71
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:20,000
even accounting for the fact
you have eight limbs to work with,

72
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:23,000
it'll be impossible for you
to plug each laceration in time,

73
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:27,000
-unless you grow another limb.
-[groaning]

74
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,000
[Blinky turns off]

75
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,000
Mmm…

76
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:10,000
If you had wrapped it around yourself,

77
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:13,000
it would have stopped the bleeding,
wouldn't it?

78
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:15,000
Guess we're both pretty stupid, huh?

79
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:40,000
How can they move so fast?

80
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:43,000
[Phinks] Looks like
he's moving better now.

81
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:45,000
[Bonolenov] Still not
at the top of his game, though.

82
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:13,000
And how is he able to leap
from that position while attacking?

83
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,000
[gasps] Now he's over there.

84
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:32,000
They're on a completely different level.

85
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:40,000
[Shizuku] Whoa. Everyone's already here?

86
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:56,000
[Shalnark] His opponent's tough.

87
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:58,000
[Phinks] It's probably the queen.

88
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,000
[Zazan] Behind me?

89
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:39,000
Curse those worthless idiots.

90
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:41,000
Were they all defeated?

91
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:10,000
How dare you scar my beautiful face!

92
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,000
[panting] You're dead.

93
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:55,000
[gasps]

94
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,000
[growls]

95
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:07,000
[gasps] But her attack
didn't make contact.

96
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,000
No.

97
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:11,000
She threw some weak aura with that swing.

98
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:14,000
Feitan's idea to use Ko
just backfired on him.

99
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:18,000
He focused every last ounce of his energy
into a single point,

100
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:20,000
and it didn't do a damn thing,

101
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:24,000
and that error delayed his defense
by a split second.

102
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:36,000
She knows how to use her aura,
that's for sure.

103
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:39,000
Well, she isn't a queen for nothing,
you know.

104
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:44,000
[Zazan laughs] My body is indestructible.

105
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,000
Shouldn't we go help him?

106
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:47,000
Huh? Why would we?

107
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:57,000
That'd be me.

108
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:01,000
[Bonolenov] Wait.
We both arrived at the same time.

109
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:03,000
Oh, give me a break.

110
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:06,000
I was just waiting
until you finished your fight, you idiot.

111
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:26,000
[Kalluto] I was naive. I thought
I could rise to number two in no time.

112
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:31,000
But I'm utterly inferior.

113
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:33,000
It's hopeless.

114
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:37,000
Still, I can't give up.

115
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:47,000
I'll get my brother back,
no matter how long it takes.

116
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:49,000
[bone cracks]

117
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:51,000
There goes his left arm.

118
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:55,000
Hey, Feitan, you ready to tag out?

119
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,000
[speaking backwards] Piece of crap…

120
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:00,000
[Phinks and Shalnark gasp]

121
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:05,000
[speaking backwards]
You shouldn't press your luck!

122
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:17,000
We tried to watch him once before,
and we almost got killed.

123
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:21,000
His ability has a pretty wide range
that's activated by rage,

124
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:23,000
so he doesn't hold back.

125
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:26,000
I'm pretty sure
this one would obliterate you,

126
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,000
and probably instantly.

127
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:29,000
[Kalluto] "This one"?

128
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:32,000
There are different kinds?

129
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:34,000
Damn it! I wanna see.

130
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,000
[speaking backwards]
I'll pay back the pain.

131
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,000
With scorching heat.

132
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,000
Pain Packer!

133
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:29,000
Huh?

134
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,000
[Kalluto panting]

135
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,000
[screams]

136
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:18,000
You can run away, you know…

137
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:49,000
[Feitan continues laughing maniacally]

138
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:54,000
[laughter fades]

139
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:07,000
Out of gas already?

140
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:10,000
And the heat really wasn't that bad.

141
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:12,000
How unfortunate.

142
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:17,000
If only you had dealt me more damage,
you'd have had a quicker death.

143
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:48,000
Would you look at that?

144
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:52,000
It doesn't seem like any of them reverted
back to normal once their queen died.

145
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,000
[Chimera Ant groaning]

146
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,000
[straining]

147
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:20,000
[stammering] Kill me.

148
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:33,000
Kill us.

149
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:39,000
[scoffs] Hell no.

150
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:43,000
I don't do mercy killings.

151
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:45,000
But feel free to attack us.

152
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:51,000
Where's your pride?

153
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:53,000
You're still natives of Meteor City,
aren't you?

154
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:55,000
What's the matter with you?

155
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:57,000
Show us you got some fight left!

156
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:36,000
Okay, but we're not leaving, right?

157
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:39,000
We really don't have anything else to do.

158
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:43,000
If any more of those Ants show up here,
I'll crush them.

159
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:46,000
Killing survivors like that
left an awful aftertaste.

160
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:49,000
-[cell phone rings]
-Is it the boss?

161
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:51,000
No, Nobunaga.

162
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:55,000
He's asking if we'll go over
and help him with his job.

163
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:56,000
He's gotta be joking.

164
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:58,000
No chance in hell! Idiot!

165
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:01,000
Ah, man. This sucks.

166
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:21,000
-Say that again, and you're dead!
-[Feitan laughs]

167
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:24,000
[Shalnark] Hey! Be careful.
We're injured, you know?

168
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:30,000
[narrator] The Phantom Troupe
has successfully saved Meteor City

169
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:32,000
from the Chimera Ant invasion.

170
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:40,000
Meanwhile…

171
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:48,000
Gon and Killua are making preparations to
infiltrate the Republic Of East Gorteau.

172
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:56,000
The selection of citizens
to be presented to the King,

173
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:58,000
carried out by his own Royal Guards…

174
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:04,000
will begin in nine days.

175
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:11,000
[closing theme music playing]

176
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:22,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

177
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:47,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
